#: ../../source/docs/common-displayport.rst:10
#: 3258cc821e2645efb42683c6d6cd6567
msgid "on F4 based autopilots, with extremely crowded OSDs (ie many panels), it is possible that if the UART used does not have DMA, that display corruption, artifacts, etc. can occur. In this rare case, move the DisplayPort connection to a UART that does have DMA."
msgstr ""

